WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,870 --> 00:00:03,830
Put your things away and I'm leaving

2
00:00:04,030 --> 00:00:05,230
If you need anything, come to me at the foot of the mountain

3
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:18,860
Left for most of the day

4
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:24,840
The rice and wheat are already ripe, really

5
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:26,320
I can really take it

6
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:44,200
Want a good life

7
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:45,800
more capital is needed

8
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,480
Also the fastest before the future

9
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:49,440
The high construction line must be maintained

10
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,760
This time we went deeper into Heixiaozi Ridge.

11
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:53,240
Buy more books

12
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:01,340
herd of small wild boars
